     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Dear all, </p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">I am using TitanCNA in order to call the CNV in tumor samples. Unfortunately, at a step in the pipeline, I am getting the error below ; </p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">please could you let me know what it means, and if there is a way to fix it. Thank you very much !</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;padding:2px 4px;color:black;white-space:nowrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245);border-radius:4px\"><br></code></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;padding:2px 4px;color:black;white-space:nowrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245);border-radius:4px\"><br></code></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;padding:2px 4px;color:black;white-space:nowrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245);border-radius:4px\">&gt; tumbamFile &lt;- &quot;T.GRCh38p5M.MD_intervals_chr19.IR.RC.bam&quot;</code></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;background-color:rgb(245,245,245);color:black;white-space:nowrap\">&gt; tumIndexFile &lt;- paste(tumbamFile,&quot;.bai&quot;,sep = &quot;&quot;)</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;background-color:rgb(245,245,245);color:black;white-space:nowrap\">&gt; vcfFile &lt;- &quot;G.GRCh38p5M.MD_samtools.germline.HETERO.chr19.vcf&quot;</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;padding:2px 4px;color:black;white-space:nowrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245);border-radius:4px\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;padding:2px 4px;border-radius:4px\">&gt; outFile &lt;- &quot;G.GRCh38p5M.MD_samtools.germline.HETERO.output.Rsamtools.v3.chr19.cluster.vcf&quot;<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&gt; pp &lt;- PileupParam(min_base_quality = 10, min_mapq = 20, <br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">+   min_nucleotide_depth = 10, max_depth = 200, <br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">+   distinguish_strands = FALSE, <br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">+   distinguish_nucleotides = TRUE)</code><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"> <br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&gt; countsDF &lt;- extractAlleleReadCounts(tumbamFile, tumIndexFile, <br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">+                                      vcfFile, outFile, <br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">+                                      pileupParam = pp)<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">Error in `[&lt;-.data.frame`(`*tmp*`, indRef, &quot;refCount&quot;, value = NULL) : <br style=\"box-sizing:borde